{"id":"655353","name":"大米发糕","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/655353/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大米","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"40g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"60g"},{"name":"水","amount":"120g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大米洗净，泡2个小时。","img":"images/655353/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放进破壁机，加120克水，用果蔬键打成浆。","img":"images/655353/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打好的米浆倒入盆中，加入酵母，糖，搅拌均匀，再倒入面粉搅拌。","img":"images/655353/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/655353/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/655353/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"醒好的米浆搅拌排气。","img":"images/655353/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"模具底和侧边刷一层薄油。","img":"images/655353/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入米浆撒上黑芝麻，葡萄干，红枣，醒发20分钟。","img":"images/655353/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"凉水下锅，开锅后蒸30分钟，关火闷5分钟。","img":"images/655353/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"脱模的时候给底下垫一个小碗，把模具往下一按。","img":"images/655353/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"模具外壳顺利脱掉。","img":"images/655353/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用刮板取掉底板。","img":"images/655353/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"香甜的大米发糕。","img":"images/655353/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}